      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Section A: History"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Section A focuses on the historical evolution and key milestones of Arunachal Pradesh.",
        "Section B covers the physical geography, river systems, and terrain of the state.",
        "Section C emphasizes the rich cultural heritage, indigenous tribes, and folk traditions.",
        "Section D examines state economy, natural resources, flora, fauna, and environmental aspects."
      ],
      "id": "jozi6f6"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "yw78zxj",
      "content": "<strong>1. Arunachal Pradesh attained full statehood on:</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "nnviinu",
      "content": "   A. 20 January 1972"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "iey9tj4",
      "content": "   B. 20 February 1987"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "zg14kuc",
      "content": "   C. 15 August 1947"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "osecelr",
      "content": "   D. 26 January 1950"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "gxesfma",
      "content": "<strong>Answer: B. 20 February 1987</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "frv4eo3",
      "content": "<strong>2. The first Chief Minister of Arunachal Pradesh as a full state was:</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "q95baef",
      "content": "   A. P.K. Thungan"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "yodfmnq",
      "content": "   B. Gegong Apang"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "wm8q5oe",
      "content": "   C. Dorjee Khandu"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "hgkfhaj",
      "content": "   D. Talom Rukbo"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "qnklnwi",
      "content": "<strong>Answer: B. Gegong Apang</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "pr3yvj8",
      "content": "<strong>3. NEFA (North-East Frontier Agency) was renamed to Arunachal Pradesh in:</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "wg7wlre",
      "content": "   A. 1950"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "yxlrlx2",
      "content": "   B. 1962"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "cawvh5h",
      "content": "   C. 1972"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "qc19sap",
      "content": "   D. 1987"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "iqyx3sa",
      "content": "<strong>Answer: C. 1972</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "u9a5m7d",
      "content": "<strong>4. The McMahon Line was established during:</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "4epm1x3",
      "content": "   A. 1885 Shimla Conference"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "q3pda5i",
      "content": "   B. 1914 Simla Convention"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "hrqd310",
      "content": "   C. 1826 Treaty of Yandabo"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "8bm35fz",
      "content": "   D. 1947 Independence"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "3dzqe5c",
      "content": "<strong>Answer: B. 1914 Simla Convention</strong>"
    },
    {
